{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本奈良世界遺產藥師寺中的國寶「佛足石」，今年4月發生遭遊客潑灑不明液體，經過調查警方鎖定一名39歲台籍女子，並在8月22日她再度入境日本時，在關西國際機場以涉嫌違反「文化財保護法」將她逮捕。</p><p>而日本媒體公布女子姓名，恰好與女星蔡頤榛（五熊）本名蔡宜臻一樣，且年齡也相同，今（8月23日）正好是五熊生日，網友也瘋猜她潑油的真正原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"4月蔡頤榛（五熊）在社交平台分享的在日本旅遊的相片（Instagram@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168231511934111744261058.jpeg/mNPEMPTuz6ARVJ6EFW_h-KzPe0lS6df8GdnqHBnZ6hw\"/><figcaption>4月蔡頤榛（五熊）在社交平台分享的在日本旅遊的相片（Instagram@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><p>更多蔡頤榛（五熊、本名蔡宜臻）的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839460303707181056078516.jpeg/kCAnXtBAmL5JlbK_tHVkhuICvJ2do2R7rU4Bu61OAbs\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839460305510862848641932.jpeg/n5AOj8uLQieGcl1c5VbjpbtByW-AYa-5A8zbNAPM2zQ\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839460307444568064029138.jpeg/1Jibctz2KKt-oFo5vjJfR9yvRbYwk6BdN8ymfzfMpn8\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839460301752504320347906.jpeg/zs2hOY4J2s1CVMuAwhdIdu5RM5O7HRxuucxP3LnMT9w\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458693581377536560837.jpeg/x1RxGTzstU9DMK3D8Wf742ctmpNrGMuZuta5drrWuXY\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458693912727552632975.jpeg/sKETpkLA7pw-L51AV6EtNY1D2-WqmsmmwEtG08BLRtM\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458688355012608315692.jpeg/oHKAPGu2Wa8HDmQXaxLRkL4lr9hSt-l6xEJdwsRCXcI\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458689567297536382064.jpeg/748D9lGE2XvRuz6SbobaU-7xKaRMX9kdfM23mHzNt5g\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458689307119616305687.jpeg/5ygQdblygg37F2_OznehDIfSz2N8wB0dueBR0bngUdE\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458691207270400054297.jpeg/Ei3jLNdumeJRi0EFgPGXlbDg3U-B5pcj3nV1md51dZk\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458691811250176835619.jpeg/1Ye4IFCb0z41ZmqT8Bm3tW_AmKkIRAHLVvy4GVb8uBk\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458684840054784952840.jpeg/QWQh-e-13tgA3hZCW65XmSZpZ2qy9v303JcawtyXGsI\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458686031237120083762.jpeg/YQObdBPigp16gLshnRJPAlcfbMZ9aVWjps6SgabOkoE\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458686521970688407563.jpeg/4g11Fm04iSajIn7Trwks6p8nz7Y-dN5VVF7UMFRe1DA\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458687298048000951043.jpeg/lXHZeIr6mC4BHdsrnFqv6iFZ0ivK83xUShhEXEoYRFw\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458682436587520120457.jpeg/8n30h1LvSDnljfv1D5CYau9JXUJnybh8iml10YppddE\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458684084948992418097.jpeg/GMDXA-ZX1JWAv4Vk2Q57P3zUzVIbhqrepl2ECaZdhAk\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240228/839458684152057856367805.jpeg/O4UAjkMreDfcxfdZF0M33w163HcgvvE40cHQjNHB0Iw\"/><figcaption>蔡頤榛（五熊）（ig@bernice0222）</figcaption></figure><p>五熊今剛好過39歲生日，卻沒想到在此時爆出疑似破壞日本國寶的醜聞，經紀人至今也尚未回應，而日本報導中提到，蔡女潑油的原因是「我會對讓我感動的東西潑油祈禱，所以也對佛足石潑了油」，網友立刻發揮偵探精神，挖出五熊是新生命教會的成員。</p><p>網友表示：</p><p>「我記得沒錯的話，五熊是新生命小組教會的（靈恩派），他們的好朋友台北靈糧堂以前也對大安森林公園的觀音像潑屎跟硫酸過」</p><p>「在基督教中，橄欖油祈禱（又稱抹油禱告或膏油禱告）是以橄欖油配合信心向神祈求的屬靈儀式」</p><p>「依照偏激靈恩派的想法就是，這是偶像雕刻之物，我要用油來潔淨」</p><p>認為若嫌犯真是五熊，應該是宗教因素才讓她犯下大錯。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：《壯志凌雲》James Handy前院遭斬殺　女友兒子自首：我是天之子】占士漢迪James Handy（《賈神探》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139563446262566912723869.png/8y54EfA220OCbBMADd235KOaiYFF_jyTygHS1coB0tU\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：《壯志凌雲》James Handy前院遭斬殺　女友兒子自首：我是天之子】占士漢迪James Handy（《賈神探》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"占士漢迪James Handy（《盧根》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139564529026338816960453.png/Zaf_N6lPFN1FoqGoE5w8bzIJy8Q8lqVAOvZXczr2V3M\"/><figcaption>占士漢迪James Handy（《盧根》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"占士漢迪James Handy（IMDb）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139564531232673792728456.png/q9U1ieqdva-qENwY4rOnxcVAgXKFFH9mhPCgJYTwoCU\"/><figcaption>占士漢迪James Handy（IMDb）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"占士漢迪James Handy（《紐約重案組》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139564533711638528276509.png/VSzQtEwWOlOjKn7ssi69dn3XIBMquLXqBI0e9gSNHvY\"/><figcaption>占士漢迪James Handy（《紐約重案組》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"占士漢迪James Handy（《X檔案》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139564535888613376831259.png/s-zRPQQEYup6sS_DTwptuohfF9HBhRyljuUiw47lIsM\"/><figcaption>占士漢迪James Handy（《X檔案》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"占士漢迪James Handy（《X檔案》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260605/1139564538036228096952870.png/3n8EN1Ewp0c08fx-rj5PHzOiAEd6oBD9FCmojxQpqI8\"/><figcaption>占士漢迪James Handy（《X檔案》劇照）</figcaption></figure><p>郭彥均挑戰極地馬拉松 熬過7天不洗澡個人排名出爐了</p><p>日本奈良國寶「佛足石」遭潑油！39歲台女遭逮　3點資訊與五熊相符</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T11:37:50.994953+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1217,"images":25,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}